        },
        {
          "text": "Basezerana na we umusi, baza iy’ ari ari benshi, mu nzu bamuhaye, arabibasobanurira, ashingira intahe ivy’ ubgami bg’Imana, abemeza ivya Yesu, abikuye mu vyagezwe vya Mose no mu vy’ abāvugishwa n’Imana, ahēra mu gitondo ashitsa ku mugoroba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
